# Allowlist: private state, journals, worktrees and caches never enter the context.
# The runtime Dockerfile copies only package inputs; the acceptance image uses tests/docs/tools.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!mql5/
!mql5/**
!configs/
!configs/news-filter.example.json
!deploy/
!deploy/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.ex5
**/*.log
